  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Posterior Uncertainty vs Sample Size $N$\n",
    "\n",
    "How do posterior standard deviations shrink as the survey grows?\n",
    "For ideal linear regression $\\sigma \\propto N^{-1/2}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
